{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/076-jiang-zhong-zi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/076-jiang-zhong-zi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 將仲子兮，無踰我里，無折我樹杞。豈敢愛之？畏我父母。仲可懷也，父母之言，亦可畏也。將仲子兮，無踰我牆，無折我樹桑。豈敢愛之？畏我諸兄。仲可懷也，諸兄之言，亦可畏也。將仲子兮，無踰我園，無折我樹檀。豈敢愛之？畏人之多言。仲可懷也，人之多言，亦可畏也。 · 方玉润 · 总评","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 將仲子 · 《诗经原始(上下)》关于“將仲子兮，無踰我里，無折我樹杞。豈敢愛之？畏我父…”的注脚：方玉润论《將仲子》不从《序》刺莊公与淫奔诗之说，认为大约是民间男女爱慕之辞，而其义又合于以理制心、以禮慎守：女子虽不能无所动，终以“父母之言”“…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"076-jiang-zhong-zi","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/076-jiang-zhong-zi/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"076-jiang-zhong-zi","title":"將仲子","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","將仲子"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"將仲子兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"無踰我里","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"無折我樹杞","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"豈敢愛之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"畏我父母","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"仲可懷也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"父母之言","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"亦可畏也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"將仲子兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"無踰我牆","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"無折我樹桑","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"豈敢愛之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"畏我諸兄","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"仲可懷也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"諸兄之言","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-016","text":"亦可畏也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-017","text":"將仲子兮","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-018","text":"無踰我園","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-019","text":"無折我樹檀","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-020","text":"豈敢愛之","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-021","text":"畏人之多言","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-022","text":"仲可懷也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-023","text":"人之多言","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-024","text":"亦可畏也","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗